Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lost in an Ahmedabad pol?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not a mistake. It's the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:06.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each pol had just one gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut it, and no outsider got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lane after lane, then a khadki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a stranger, a maze!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And hidden passages between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a raid, families could slip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:20.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:23.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Messages travelled roof to roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole pol, like a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:25.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:28.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 2017, this city of pols
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:28.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,India's first World Heritage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:31.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,City!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Write your pol's name in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:34.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
